### =============================================
### CRASH & RECOVERY TEST SCENARIOS
### =============================================
### Các kịch bản test khả năng recovery của hệ thống
### =============================================

### --- Setup: Check initial state ---
GET http://localhost:8001/api/accounts

###
GET http://localhost:8001/api/recovery/status

###

### =============================================
### SCENARIO 1: Crash sau PREPARE, trước COMMIT
### Mô phỏng: Coordinator crash sau khi gửi PREPARE
### =============================================

### 1.1 Gửi PREPARE - account sẽ bị lock
POST http://localhost:8001/api/prepare
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-CRASH-001",
    "account_id": "ACC001",
    "operation": "DEBIT",
    "amount": 100000
}

### 1.2 Verify account locked
GET http://localhost:8001/api/accounts/ACC001

### 1.3 Check transaction pending (giả lập coordinator crash - không gửi COMMIT)
GET http://localhost:8001/api/recovery/status

### 1.4 Manual recovery: Force rollback
POST http://localhost:8001/api/recovery/force-rollback

### 1.5 Verify account unlocked
GET http://localhost:8001/api/accounts/ACC001

###

### =============================================
### SCENARIO 2: Multiple PREPARED transactions
### Nhiều giao dịch pending cùng lúc
### =============================================

### 2.1 PREPARE trên ACC002
POST http://localhost:8001/api/prepare
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-MULTI-001",
    "account_id": "ACC002",
    "operation": "DEBIT",
    "amount": 50000
}

### 2.2 PREPARE trên ACC003
POST http://localhost:8001/api/prepare
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-MULTI-002",
    "account_id": "ACC003",
    "operation": "CREDIT",
    "amount": 100000
}

### 2.3 PREPARE trên ACC004
POST http://localhost:8001/api/prepare
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-MULTI-003",
    "account_id": "ACC004",
    "operation": "DEBIT",
    "amount": 75000
}

### 2.4 Check tất cả pending
GET http://localhost:8001/api/recovery/status

### 2.5 Force rollback all
POST http://localhost:8001/api/recovery/force-rollback

### 2.6 Verify all accounts unlocked
GET http://localhost:8001/api/accounts

###

### =============================================
### SCENARIO 3: Stale lock cleanup
### Account bị lock nhưng không có transaction tương ứng
### =============================================

### Note: Scenario này khó test trực tiếp vì cần tạo inconsistent state
### Dùng endpoint cleanup-locks để dọn các lock cũ

### 3.1 Check for stale locks
POST http://localhost:8001/api/recovery/cleanup-locks

###

### =============================================
### SCENARIO 4: Idempotent PREPARE
### Gửi PREPARE nhiều lần với cùng TX ID
### =============================================

### 4.1 PREPARE lần 1
POST http://localhost:8001/api/prepare
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-IDEMPOTENT-001",
    "account_id": "ACC005",
    "operation": "DEBIT",
    "amount": 200000
}

### 4.2 PREPARE lần 2 (cùng TX ID) - phải trả về cùng kết quả
POST http://localhost:8001/api/prepare
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-IDEMPOTENT-001",
    "account_id": "ACC005",
    "operation": "DEBIT",
    "amount": 200000
}

### 4.3 COMMIT
POST http://localhost:8001/api/commit
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-IDEMPOTENT-001"
}

### 4.4 COMMIT lần 2 (idempotent) - phải trả về cùng kết quả
POST http://localhost:8001/api/commit
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-IDEMPOTENT-001"
}

###

### =============================================
### SCENARIO 5: Idempotent ROLLBACK
### =============================================

### 5.1 PREPARE
POST http://localhost:8001/api/prepare
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-IDEMPOTENT-002",
    "account_id": "ACC001",
    "operation": "CREDIT",
    "amount": 300000
}

### 5.2 ROLLBACK lần 1
POST http://localhost:8001/api/rollback
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-IDEMPOTENT-002"
}

### 5.3 ROLLBACK lần 2 (idempotent)
POST http://localhost:8001/api/rollback
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-IDEMPOTENT-002"
}

###

### =============================================
### SCENARIO 6: COMMIT without PREPARE
### =============================================

POST http://localhost:8001/api/commit
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-NO-PREPARE"
}
### Expected: 404 - Transaction not found

###

### =============================================
### SCENARIO 7: Double lock prevention
### Không cho 2 TX khác lock cùng 1 account
### =============================================

### 7.1 TX1 PREPARE
POST http://localhost:8001/api/prepare
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-LOCK-001",
    "account_id": "ACC003",
    "operation": "DEBIT",
    "amount": 100000
}

### 7.2 TX2 PREPARE cùng account (should fail)
POST http://localhost:8001/api/prepare
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-LOCK-002",
    "account_id": "ACC003",
    "operation": "CREDIT",
    "amount": 50000
}
### Expected: 409 - Account locked by TX-LOCK-001

### 7.3 Cleanup: Rollback TX1
POST http://localhost:8001/api/rollback
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-LOCK-001"
}

### 7.4 Now TX2 can proceed
POST http://localhost:8001/api/prepare
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-LOCK-002",
    "account_id": "ACC003",
    "operation": "CREDIT",
    "amount": 50000
}

### 7.5 COMMIT TX2
POST http://localhost:8001/api/commit
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-LOCK-002"
}

###

### =============================================
### CLEANUP: Reset everything
### =============================================

### Force rollback all pending
POST http://localhost:8001/api/recovery/force-rollback

### Cleanup stale locks
POST http://localhost:8001/api/recovery/cleanup-locks

### Reset account balances (optional)
POST http://localhost:8001/api/single/reset-account/ACC001?new_balance=10000000

###
POST http://localhost:8001/api/single/reset-account/ACC002?new_balance=5000000

###
POST http://localhost:8001/api/single/reset-account/ACC003?new_balance=15000000

###
POST http://localhost:8001/api/single/reset-account/ACC004?new_balance=8000000

###
POST http://localhost:8001/api/single/reset-account/ACC005?new_balance=20000000

### Final check
GET http://localhost:8001/api/accounts


